  title: THE GATE
  body: 'GOAL: get through the locked gate. The wall runs to both edges of the jungle,
    so there is no way round.

    HOW: the wheel to the east opens it, but two guards
    defend it. Deal with them first.

    RESULT: a message tells you when the gate
    is open.'
