  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: RALLY POINT
  body: 'GOAL: replace the troops you have lost.

    HOW: stand on the blue pad.
    Recruits join you automatically, up to the number you lost, from this point''s
    limited reserve. They fill the troop type you lost the most of.

    RESULT:
    a banner shows how many joined. If your army is full, nothing is used. Recruits
    arrive without gear.'
  radius: 4.5
