  title: CARRY YARD
  body: 'GOAL: finish two jobs. Both are done by carrying.

    HOW: JOB 1 is north,
    carry the crate to the glowing ring. JOB 2 is south, carry the key to the yellow
    disc. Follow the signs.

    RESULT: a message appears every time you finish
    a job.'
