  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6dffaeb1f6b7ca4cb5ce48f87980a3a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: THE OUTPOST
  body: 'GOAL: take this outpost from the enemy and win its supplies.

    HOW: there
    are three jobs. JOB 1, capture the red ring to the north-east. JOB 2, escort
    a cart to that ring (it only works once the ring is yours). JOB 3, the armory
    in the south-east opens when a cart arrives. In the north-west there is some
    gold lying about.

    RESULT: a message appears every time you finish something.'
  radius: 4
