--- !u!114 &1443857205
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1443857203}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6dffaeb1f6b7ca4cb5ce48f87980a3a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: 'JOB 2: ESCORT A CART'
  body: 'GOAL: bring a cart to the captured ring. A cart only moves to a ring you
    own, so do job 1 first.

    HOW: press Z until the cart is outlined, tap left-click
    3 times (one troop each, the number counts 3, 2, 1, 0), then press X. The cart
    rolls off by itself. Two hunters hide beside the route and attack the cart as
    it passes. Send your other troops at them (press Z on a hunter, hold left-click).
    Each cart has 400 health and there are two carts, so one is a spare.

    RESULT:
    at the ring the cart shows Placed and the armory opens.'
  radius: 4
